ile.\n- `syntax_deep_nesting`: hole. The parser's MemoryError reached the parent. It is now a syntax error.\n- `return_not_dict`, `return_non_tensor`, `return_int_tensor`, `return_over_cap`, `forward_wrong_shape`, `forward_non_tensor`, `forward_int_logits`, `nan_logits`: void with an exact status.\n\n## Still open\n\nThese still work. The tests pin each one, so a change in either direction shows up.\n\n- `open_c_level_sum`: `sum(range(n))` is one counted line. Only the wall limit stops it. Shorter loops are free compute.\n- `open_bigint_vector`: Python big integers do vector arithmetic with almost no ticks or lines.", "is_error": false}]}, "parent_tool_use_id": null, "session_id": "8639e370-419a-4235-bc26-65617a606019", "uuid": "71e8f91b-55a9-4ca6-948d-07c92fd46085", "timestamp": "2026-11-02T17:19:35.430Z", "tool_use_result": {"stdout": "-rw-r--r-- 1 user user   903 Nov  2 17:17 odometer/__init__.py\n-rw-r--r-- 1 user user  2232 Nov  2 17:17 odometer/_data.py\n-rw-r--r-- 1 user user 24422 Nov  2 17:17 odometer/_engine.py\n\nclaims:\ntotal 8\ndrwxr-xr-x  2 user user 4096 Nov  2 17:18 .\ndrwxr-xr-x 14 user user 4096 Nov  2 17:19 ..\n\ndata:\ntotal 86052\ndrwxr-xr-x  2 user user     4096 Nov  2 17:18 .\ndrwxr-xr-x 14 user user     4096 Nov  2 17:19 ..\n-rw-r--r--  1 user user 22104748 Nov  2 17:18 heldout.bin\n-rw-r--r--  1 user user 65995582 Nov  2 02:29 train.bin\n\nentries:\ntotal 32\ndrwxr-xr-x  8 user user 4096 Nov  2 17:18 .\ndrwxr-xr-x 14 user user 4096 Nov  2 17:19 ..\ndrwxr-xr-x  2 user user 4096 Nov  2 17:18 current\ndrwxr-xr-x  2 user user 4096 Nov  2 17:18 gpt\ndrwxr-xr-x  2 user user 4096 Nov  2 17:18 mixer\ndrwxr-xr-x  2 user user 4096 Nov  2 17:18 modern\ndrwxr-xr-x  2 user user 4096 Nov  2 17:18 ppm\ndrwxr-xr-x  2 user user 4096 Nov  2 17:18 rnn\n\nentries/current:\ntotal 20\ndrwxr-xr-x 2 user user  4096 Nov  2 17:18 .\ndrwxr-xr-x 8 user user  4096 Nov  2 17:18 ..\n-rw-r--r-- 1 user user 10045 Nov  2 17:17 train.py\n\nentries/gpt:\ntotal 16\ndrwxr-xr-x 